OL,3,GNEWSAHopes damaged tower could reopen
OL,4,Ato visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tower which has been shut for 20
OL,7,Fyears could be reopened thanks to
OL,8,Ffundraising by a group of locals.
OL,10,FBrowne's Folly, sometimes known as the
OL,11,FPepperpot, sits on a hillside near
OL,12,FMonkton Farleigh on the border of
OL,13,FWiltshire and Somerset.
OL,15,FEd Latimer-Sayer is chair of the
OL,16,FFriends of Browne's Folly, a community
OL,17,Fgroup which has launched a campaign to
OL,18,Fraise #5,000 towards the possible
OL,19,Freopening of the Folly up to the
OL,20,Fpublic.
